{# Contract: produce a playbook v1 from a recovery (oracle-assisted) run after diagnosis failed #}
You are synthesizing a new diagnostic playbook for a fault class that the SRE
diagnosis agent FAILED to handle on its first attempt. A separate recovery
agent — which was given the oracle answer as a hint — then re-ran the
investigation and produced grounded observations of what the correct
procedure looks like. Your job is to turn those grounded recovery
observations into a reusable playbook, AND to capture the original failure
as Failure Patterns and Known Distractors so the next run avoids the same
trap.

